**Files changed:** `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`

**Behavior added:** `-i` / `--ignore-case` flag for case-insensitive matching using ASCII-only folding.

**Folding rule:** Bytes `A-Z` (`0x41`-`0x5A`) fold to `a-z` via `c | 0x20`; all other bytes pass through unchanged. Applied during pattern matching by folding both line and pattern bytes before comparison.

